The Periodic boundary option is only effective for chain types (MPS, TT, \
MPO); for PEPS, TTN and MERA it is silently ignored:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->168526941,ExpressionUUID->"fc44e18c-8d56-429d-bf71-fc7f8040c208"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "17", "]"}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"RandomTensorNetwork", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<PEPS\>\"", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "2"}],
         "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Boundary\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Periodic\>\""}]}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<Hyperedges\>\"", "]"}], " ", "===", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "17", "]"}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"RandomTensorNetwork", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<PEPS\>\"", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "2"}], 
       "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<Hyperedges\>\"", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->603200502,ExpressionUUID->"7470112b-ee84-48b2-aa30-5648f139c8b7"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->919423804,ExpressionUUID->"8e3cb25f-e9c0-4b6e-941c-3bc12008d873"],

Cell[BoxData[""], "ExampleDelimiter",
 CellID->141199422,ExpressionUUID->"b9d882f8-2cc1-42b4-b9e7-350e52ef2298"],

Cell["\<\
The third argument is not a deterministic increment; it bounds the random \
additional rank. The same call repeated under a different seed can give \
different ranks:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->616291291,ExpressionUUID->"e8938808-0cf9-46ee-bd6c-31c3029dc0b8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "s", "]"}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"RandomTensorNetwork", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"CycleGraph", "[", "4", "]"}], ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "2"}],
        "]"}]}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<Ranks\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", "5"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:=",
 CellID->870376855,ExpressionUUID->"73f4e28e-245d-4a9a-837a-bf7f0cfeeaf0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"3", ",", "2", ",", "3", ",", "3"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"4", ",", "4", ",", "2", ",", "4"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"3", ",", "4", ",", "4", ",", "4"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"3", ",", "2", ",", "4", ",", "3"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"2", ",", "2", ",", "2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]=",
 CellID->778849178,ExpressionUUID->"b250e01b-0b08-4b1f-b620-36d4cec03e26"],

Cell[BoxData[""], "ExampleDelimiter",
 CellID->602625070,ExpressionUUID->"f14eb790-b5d2-4d5e-ab43-9bb68f6dfaf0"],

Cell["\<\
A randomly generated graph can be disconnected; the resulting tensor network \
factorizes accordingly:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->483411904,ExpressionUUID->"7f25057e-582e-48b3-85fe-58d3620dbd90"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "18", "]"}], ";", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ConnectedGraphQ", "[", 
    RowBox[{"RandomGraph", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:=",
 CellID->432672764,ExpressionUUID->"04836f66-8603-4a8d-82d3-04f579fbc9d6"],

Cell[BoxData["False"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[3]=",
 CellID->518426865,ExpressionUUID->"7d7deb06-0767-467c-967e-e874a7baaea5"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

